VT-11: involves → HV-09, HV-13; bounds → F7, F8; strained-by → TECH-11; tested-by → UC04-F8-PR8, UC04-F8-CL13.

VT-12: involves → HV-09, HV-13; bounds → UC05 (later cycle).

VT-13: involves → HV-12, HV-14; bounds → F8, F9; tested-by → UC04-F9-CL18, UC04-F9-CL20.

VT-14: involves → HV-11, HV-13; bounds → F7, F8, F10; strained-by → TECH-16 (deferred), TECH-17 (rejected for straining it most); tested-by → UC04-F7-CL16, UC04-F9-CL20.
